    "chunk_text": "de, \u00fea he cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6t his \u00dea ascedan hiene his \u00feegnas hwy he swa heanlice word be him selfum gecw\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00dea ondwyrde he him, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: gif ic eft gefare swelcne sige \u00e6t Romanum, \u00feonne m\u00e6g ic si\u00fe\u00fean \u00de\u00e6t wear\u00f0 eac Romanum an yfelum tacne o\u00feiewed \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte, \u00fea hie on firde w\u00e6ron, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gefuhton Pirrus & Romane in Abulia \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feeode. \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Pirrus wund on o\u00feran earme; & Romane h\u00e6fdon sige. & h\u00e6fdon geleornad ma cr\u00e6fta hu hie \u00fea elpendas beswican mehton, mid \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fe\u00e6t hie namon On \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte w\u00e6s Romana eahta \u00feusend ofslagen, & enlefan gu\u00f0fonan genumen, & Pirruses \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Pirruse cu\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Agathocles, Siraccusa cyning \u00feara burgleoda, w\u00e6s gefaren on Sicilia \u00dea for he \u00feider & \u00fe\u00e6t rice to him geniedde. Sona swa \u00fe\u00e6t gewinn mid Romanum geendad w\u00e6s, swa w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r seo monigfealdeste wol, mid \u00dea wende Pirrus from Sicilium eft to Romanum, & him angean com Curius se consul, & hiora \u00fe\u00e6t Ac si\u00fe\u00fean hi \u00fea gesawan, hie hie gegremedan, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fea w\u00e6ron swi\u00fee sleande \u00fee hie fylstan On \u00f0\u00e6m gefeohte Pirrus h\u00e6fde eahtatig M fe\u00feena, & V M gehorsedra. & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s XXXVI M ofslagen, & IIII hund",
